 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Good that you' thinking about it. simple runner lanyard is right up there. It hangs around your neck while you' out on the trail. Then a little light and small mirror are useful too. She'll want small pocket mirror to touch up her makeup. She' probably stop at several stops and start again, so a simple timer would be great. Definitely. A bright light that you can hang on a loop on your arm. She'll be cold for a while. A light layer under her clothing that she can take off layering under her jacket. A thin base layer that she can wear under a thin jacket.",
